		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Gundam Build Divers\", the heroine Sarah appears as a character!",
			"• Face parts are selectable between a gentle expression and a smile.",
			"• The head parts are replaceable so you can recreate Petitgguy!",
			"• The back hair is a separate part and can be cutely moved!",
			"• Comes with a pedestal that can be connected to other Charaggi!"
